# Historical note (superseded 2026-08-02, Fase 5): this file used to blanket-
# ignore every subdirectory (`*/`) because this repository versioned only
# loose cross-project documentation, and each domain (f1-predictor,
# cs-predictor, lol-predictor, cripto-predictor, brasileirao-predictor) plus
# the shared core-predictor/tools-predictor already lived in their own
# independent GitHub repositories. That workspace-of-siblings layout predates
# the current architecture: this repository (ecosystem-predictor) is now the
# real aggregator platform itself (src/ecosystem/, tests/, migrations/,
# docker/), not just a documentation hub, per ECOSYSTEM_RULES.md and
# prompt_fase_5.md. The other 5 domain repos and the 2 shared libraries
# remain independent Git repositories, unmodified by this change - only
# ecosystem-predictor's own long-standing "ignore everything" rule is lifted.

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
dist/
build/
.env
.ecosystem-runtime/

# Logs e backups gerados localmente não são versionados.
*.log

# Alerta de saude das tarefas: estado de runtime, criado/apagado pelo
# tools/monitor_task_health.ps1. A PRESENCA do arquivo e o sinal.
ALERTA_TAREFAS.txt
